body:
If we're deferring adding a plugin, should we also defer removing a plugin? Otherwise, I think if we did:

```
add_extension_editor_plugin("MyPlugin");
remove_extension_editor_plugin("MyPlugin");
```

... it would actually lead to a segfault, because the removal would run and delete the plugin before it was even fully added, and when it was added, the object would no longer be valid

